# Line endings are not a platform preference here.
#
# The formatter writes LF, the gates that read source compare text, and a
# checkout on Windows that converted files to CRLF made both disagree with
# what was committed - nine files had arrived with CRLF by v0.77. `text=auto
# eol=lf` keeps every working copy LF on every platform, as dowel does.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, and not to be touched.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
